  "flavor_text": {
    "one_line": "Reflective forest elves who pursue balance through study, silence, and deliberate self-restraint.",
    "one_paragraph": "The Orunai build quiet hamlets among fog-veiled glades, where archives stand beside meditation pools and public debate is expected to end in contemplation rather than victory. They value learning that humbles rather than inflates the ego, and their elders teach that every passion must be understood before it can be trusted. Outsiders find them patient hosts, but rarely quick allies, for the Orunai distrust every cause that demands immediate certainty."
